| Approach | Use Case | Examples |
|----------|----------|----------|
| **Secrets Manager** | Production | AWS Secrets Manager, HashiCorp Vault, Azure Key Vault |
| **K8s Secrets** | Containerized | K8s Secrets objects |
| **Cloud Provider Metadata** | Cloud deployed | AWS ECS, GCP Cloud Run metadata service |
| **Environment injection** | CI/CD | Injected at container/runtime start |

