### 5. 🚨 No Request Size Limits (OWASP A04:2021 - Insecure Design)

**Issue:** No protection against large payload attacks (e.g., buffer overflow, DoS).

```javascript
// CURRENT: No limits - vulnerable to large request attacks
app.use(express.json());
```

**Recommendation:** Add size limits to all body parsers:

```javascript
// Limit JSON body to 100KB
app.use(express.json({ limit: '100kb' }));

// Limit URL-encoded form data
app.use(express.urlencoded({ extended: true, limit: '100kb' }));

// Disable XML entity parsing (XXE protection)
app.use(express.text({ type: 'application/xml' }));
```

